  "body": "Step up to a lifestyle of comfort, flexibility, and breathtaking views in this beautifully elevated family haven, perfectly\r\npositioned in a tranquil, no-exit enclave in highly sought-after Stanmore Bay.\r\n\r\nA Home That Grows With You:\r\nThis expansive residence is thoughtfully designed for super-extended families, those seeking multi-generational living, or savvy investors looking to maximize both lifestyle and income. Spread out across two generous levels, every detail is designed for effortless living and future flexibility.\r\n\r\nGround Floor Highlights:\r\n• A welcoming, grand entrance\r\n• Spacious double internal access garage for the main house\r\n• Versatile rumpus room with a full bathroom – ideal for grany or teen retreats or home offices\r\n• Well-equipped laundry\r\n• Legal, self-contained 2-bedroom income suite featuring its own single internal garage\r\n• Six off-street parking spaces for family and guests\r\n• Fully fenced and easy-care section – no lawns to mow, but enjoy your own established family orchard for year-round harvests\r\n\r\nUpper Floor Retreat:\r\n• Four double bedrooms and two modern bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n• Light-filled, open-plan kitchen and an immense living area – perfect for entertaining or unwinding\r\n• Step onto the balcony and soak in panoramic sea views and the lush, green outlook over nearby sports grounds\r\n\r\nWhy This Property Is Special:\r\n• Dual-income potential: Enjoy steady returns or offset your mortgage with the legal 2-bedroom suite\r\n• Effortless living: Low maintenance, move-in ready, with a fixed tenant keen to stay\r\n• Space for everyone: Ideal for large, blended, or multi-generational families\r\n• Positioned for peace: Quiet, safe, and elevated for privacy and inspiring perspectives\r\n• Peninsula's sought-after neighbourhoods\r\n\r\nThis is your chance to secure a home that truly delivers - whether you’re striving for the ultimate family lifestyle, seeking a future-proof investment, or both. Properties of this calibre, with so much flexibility and potential, are rarely available and always in high demand.\r\n\r\nTry to imagine the attraction of the property market of Stanmore Bay when the Pen-link opens...\r\n\r\nMotivated seller!\r\n\r\nContact us today for your private viewing and take the first step towards your new chapter in this exceptional home.\r\nLet’s make your dream a reality!",
